    "detailed_description": "<strong><i>Welcome to the World of Robot Combat with &quot;AI.Gears&quot;!</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2>&quot;AI.Gears&quot; is an innovative robot combat game that combines advanced technology and creativity, allowing players to assemble and customize robots for strategic battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><strong>Diverse Robots</strong><br>Encounter robots with distinct styles and abilities in &quot;AI.Gears.&quot; Players can strategize and leverage these diverse robots to their advantage.<br><br><strong>Customization</strong><br>Freedom to assemble and modify robots according to personal preferences, enhancing the strategic depth of the gaming experience.<br><br><strong>Reinforcement Learning AI</strong><br>The game employs reinforcement learning AI in an automatic combat system, enabling robots to learn and improve their performance, providing a unique element to the gaming experience.<br><br><strong>1v1 Tag Matches</strong><br>Engage in 1v1 tag matches, where cooperation and strategy with a partner are crucial for victory.<br><br><strong>Real-time PvP and PvE</strong><br>Rich real-time PvP and PvE content allows players to test and enhance their combat skills in various scenarios.<br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;AI.Gears&quot; invites players to explore the limitless possibilities of robot combat, offering a diverse range of strategic elements and enjoyment. Challenge yourself today!</i></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><i>Welcome to the World of Robot Combat with &quot;AI.Gears&quot;!</i></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2>&quot;AI.Gears&quot; is an innovative robot combat game that combines advanced technology and creativity, allowing players to assemble and customize robots for strategic battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><strong>Diverse Robots</strong><br>Encounter robots with distinct styles and abilities in &quot;AI.Gears.&quot; Players can strategize and leverage these diverse robots to their advantage.<br><br><strong>Customization</strong><br>Freedom to assemble and modify robots according to personal preferences, enhancing the strategic depth of the gaming experience.<br><br><strong>Reinforcement Learning AI</strong><br>The game employs reinforcement learning AI in an automatic combat system, enabling robots to learn and improve their performance, providing a unique element to the gaming experience.<br><br><strong>1v1 Tag Matches</strong><br>Engage in 1v1 tag matches, where cooperation and strategy with a partner are crucial for victory.<br><br><strong>Real-time PvP and PvE</strong><br>Rich real-time PvP and PvE content allows players to test and enhance their combat skills in various scenarios.<br><br><br><strong><i>&quot;AI.Gears&quot; invites players to explore the limitless possibilities of robot combat, offering a diverse range of strategic elements and enjoyment. Challenge yourself today!</i></strong>",
